1
00:00:00,898 --> 00:00:03,858
(Leonard:)- Just give us a few minutes.
- I'm running really late.

2
00:00:04,026 --> 00:00:05,406
(Sheldon:)Then I have a simple solution.

3
00:00:05,569 --> 00:00:08,569
(Sheldon:)Go up to the roof, hop over
to the next building... There's a gap.

4
00:00:08,739 --> 00:00:12,539
(Sheldon:)Don't look down if you're subject
to vertigo... and use their stairwell.

5
00:00:12,827 --> 00:00:16,997
- You're joking, right?
- Oh, I never joke when it comes to vertigo.

6
00:00:18,624 --> 00:00:21,004
(Penny:)Damn. Okay, I'll just take the roof.

7
00:00:21,168 --> 00:00:23,378
(Leonard:)If you wait for us
to set up the time machine...

8
00:00:23,546 --> 00:00:25,716
(Leonard:)...I can drop you off at work yesterday.

9
00:00:27,967 --> 00:00:29,967
Time-travel joke. It's not... Never mind.

10
00:00:32,221 --> 00:00:34,721
(Sheldon:)For what it's worth,
I thought it was humorous.

11
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:35,970
[CHORTLES]

12
00:00:38,561 --> 00:00:39,891
(Leonard:)Let's just do this.

13
00:00:40,062 --> 00:00:42,602
- You guys ready to push?
RAJESH: In a minute.

14
00:00:42,773 --> 00:00:45,403
(Raj:)Howard stepped outside to throw up.

15
00:00:50,323 --> 00:00:54,743
(Sheldon:)I don't know what you were worried about.
I think it really works in the room.

16
00:00:55,494 --> 00:00:59,124
(Leonard:)Yeah. It is by far the coolest thing
I have ever owned.

17
00:00:59,290 --> 00:01:02,250
(Sheldon:)The exact time machine
that carried actor Rod Taylor...

